  "overview": "All 104 registered training runs completed: 39 development and 65 confirmation. Thirteen methods continued to five-seed confirmation on fresh synthetic circle data. Independent replay checked 65 endpoints, 104000 predictions and 150 saved shot arrays.",
  "findings": "Confirmation mean macro-F1 was 97.42% for k-means routed depth-two circuits, 90.10% for hash routing with the same 40 circuit angles, 94.06% for a fixed depth-four circuit and 98.70% for the larger classical MLP. Routing improved the circuit model, while the spatial partition also added classical capacity.",
